// Send feedback's Bellhop report key (https://blhp.app/docs/feedback): publishable, it can only
// send feedback to Hex. It never goes in source: Feedback.local.xcconfig (gitignored) sets it for
// a local build, and ci_scripts/ci_post_clone.sh writes that file on Xcode Cloud from the
// BELLHOP_REPORT_KEY secret. Empty, Hex shows no Send feedback row. It reaches the app as
// Info.plist's BellhopReportKey (Feedback.reportKey).
BELLHOP_REPORT_KEY =
#include? "Feedback.local.xcconfig"
